# Titan of Industry, modes 1 and 2 (a land is no target for the first; the second takes the opponent). Bot1 casts it on turn 3 from a
# Black Lotus (GGG) and four Moxen, destroys Bot2's Mox Ruby and has Bot2 gain 5 life (20 -> 25). Bot2's Island is refused as a
# target for the destroy mode, and Titan shows Reach and Trample.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Titan of Industry
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Island
Island x20

